WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.640
A good evaluation is fair, and can be shown to be fair.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:08.570
Each evaluator sets their own scores.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:17.300
Only people set the scores. The total is worked out the same way every time, and AI never sets or changes a mark.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.350
An outcome you can stand behind.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.920
Velstrian Buy.
